<Base title="Technology, implementation and reseller partnerships" description="Explore a Smart Exam partnership for customer-hosted examination workflows, implementation and professional assessment services."><section class="page-hero"><div class="container page-title-only"><span class="eyebrow">Partner with Smart Exam</span><h1>Bring examination operations to your customers.</h1><p class="intro">For technology integrators, learning solution providers and assessment specialists exploring a complementary customer-hosted examination offer.</p></div></section><section class="form-section"><div class="container form-layout"><aside class="form-aside"><h2>Build a clear division of responsibilities.</h2><p>Explore referral, implementation, reseller or technology collaboration. Product fit, delivery capability and support responsibilities come first.</p><div class="steps"><div class="step"><strong>Find a relevant use case</strong><p>Examinations alongside learning, training and enterprise systems.</p></div><div class="step"><strong>Validate delivery together</strong><p>Agree technical scope, training, acceptance and customer support.</p></div><div class="step"><strong>Establish commercial terms</strong><p>Written account ownership, pricing authority and partner responsibilities.</p></div></div><p style="margin-top:25px;font-size:.82rem">Submitting an inquiry does not establish partner status, exclusivity or permission to make product commitments.</p></aside><LeadForm kind="partner" buttonLabel="Discuss a partnership" /></div></section></Base>
